review_text:
Sucker for love is almost everything you'd want in an eldritch dating simulator; 
I first played through the first chapter on the Dread X Collection 2 in 2020 and was delighted to see that it was becoming a fully realised game.
it was a genuine joy to play through multiple chapters of this, its cute and cheery while having those fun Lovecraftian elements and overall has fun with its concept.
